OL,3,GNEWSANo budget resolution reached yet,
OL,4,Asays O'Neill
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo resolution has been reached yet in
OL,7,Fnegotiations between executive parties
OL,8,Fand the secretary of state, First
OL,9,FMinister Michelle O'Neill has said.
OL,11,FSpeaking after a series of one-to-one
OL,12,Fmeetings with Sir Chris Bryant, O'Neill
OL,13,Fsaid there was still "no white smoke".
OL,15,FDemocratic Unionist Party leader (DUP)
OL,16,FGavin Robinson said he felt there was a
OL,17,Flevel of optimism that was "not matched
OL,18,Fby the reality inside" the room during
OL,19,Ftalks.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
